### Extraction rules

- Every decision must have evidence.
- Every action item must have evidence.
- Evidence quotes must be verbatim.
- Never invent deadlines.
- Resolve relative deadlines using the meeting date.
- If a deadline is unclear, return null.
- If ownership is unclear, return unassigned.
- Distinguish suggestions from commitments.
- Distinguish proposed decisions from finalized decisions.
- Detect duplicate action items.
- Low-confidence results must require human review.

Validate all AI output with Zod.

